<title>USA: Fed says 5-day fixed-system RP's total $4.912 bln.</title>
<headline>Fed says 5-day fixed-system RP's total $4.912 bln.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Federal Reserve said its five-day fixed-system repurchase operation on Thursday would add $4.912 billion in temporary reserves to the banking system.</p>
<p>(( -- N.A. Treasury Desk 212-859-1660))</p>
</text>
